TI  - Sibling Spillovers in Rural China: A Story of Sisters
AU  - Bansak, Cynthia
AU  - Jiang, Xuan
AU  - Yang, Guanyi
PY  - 2022
DA  - 2022/12
JO  - China Economic Review
